<title>USA: American United Global to buy BTS Cos.</title>
<headline>American United Global to buy BTS Cos.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American United Global Inc said Thursday it signed a letter of intent to acquire the BTS Companies.</p>
<p>BTS comprises Broadcast Tower Sites Inc and Spectrum Tech Inc and their affiliates.</p>
<p>American United agreed to pay $1 million in cash and 700,000 shares of its common stock subject to certain conditions.</p>
<p>American United stock rose 1 to 10-1/2 in Nasdaq on Thursday.</p>
<p>Closing of the deal is subject to due diligence and the execution of definitive agreements.</p>
</text>
